{"availability":"available","full":"aryansajiv19/plan-ind","name":"plan-ind","description":"Group plans in Dubai, decided in three rounds. Next.js 16 · React 19 · Supabase (RLS, Realtime) · OpenAI. Live demo ↓","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-02T14:30:53Z","updated":"2026-10-01T21:20:37Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://plan-ind.vercel.app","topics":["dubai","nextjs","openai","playwright","postgresql","react","realtime","row-level-security","supabase","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://plan-ind.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:08.425Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:08.425Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:08.425Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:08.425Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A real-time group planning app for Dubai: the host sets constraints, the app shortlists venues, and the group votes through elimination rounds to a decision.","Most planning tools help once a group has already decided. Planind targets the step before that, when a group chat has six suggestions and no decision. A host picks a budget, a travel radius and the kind of outing; the app deals nine venues from a curated Dubai catalogue, each with the reason it qualified, and participants vote live.","After a winner is chosen the plan continues into RSVPs, carpools, calendar invites, directions, weather and post-visit ratings."],"features":["Votes are enforced by the database. Every ballot goes through a PostgreSQL function; concurrent duplicate votes resolve to a single row, verified by race-condition tests.","Search indexed for the slow case. A trigram index cut venue searches that match nothing from 2.26 ms to 0.07 ms on a 5,082-venue benchmark dataset.","Hardened external fetching. Importing a venue from a user-supplied URL is protected against SSRF, including DNS rebinding.","Measured under load. 200 simultaneous voters completed in under 250 ms on a local stack, at about 0.5 ms of database time per vote."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryansajiv19/plan-ind/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"00855a955c3bbe3461e73a824ea68aa485d788dc8355d46bcf48627c75614066","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:08.543Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:08.543Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A real-time group planning app for Dubai: the host sets constraints, the app shortlists venues, and the group votes through elimination rounds to a decision.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryansajiv19/plan-ind/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Live app · Demo, no account required","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryansajiv19/plan-ind/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Members open the shared link, sign in and vote.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryansajiv19/plan-ind/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Encoding these in a PostgreSQL function makes them atomic under concurrency, at the cost of logic that lives outside the TypeScript codebase and needs its own database test suite.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryansajiv19/plan-ind/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"00855a955c3bbe3461e73a824ea68aa485d788dc8355d46bcf48627c75614066","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryansajiv19/plan-ind/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:08.543Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T21:20:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryansajiv19/plan-ind/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:08.544Z","hash":"00855a955c3bbe3461e73a824ea68aa485d788dc8355d46bcf48627c75614066","originalBytes":7657,"storedBytes":7657,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["supabase","venue","database","search","live","tests","api","against","app","realtime","votes","every","index","lo